  "about": "Anthony is currently employed as Software Engineer at VAR Technology Finance in Mesquite, Texas, and is a website interface designer, video producer and editor, and a media director working as a self-employed contractor. \n\nAnthony has spent much of his career working in creative design and web development, both in a full-time and contract capacity. He has been a part of a team designing several major websites for Smart Travel and Trinity Church, and has been the Project Director and Creative Director for three major site launches with Trinity Church. He has also worked as a Project Manager and Creative Director in a contractor role, dealing with sub-contractors and interfacing with multiple departments within his client's companies.\n\nAnthony is a seasoned event media manager, a video producer with an eye for the soul of a moment, and a motion graphics designer. He has shot several documentary-style short videos and event recaps on many locations for Trinity Church Dallas. He is also a gifted stage performer with years of experience in dealing with the dynamic challenges that arise in live situations, and providing split-second solutions to problems that require immediate action. On the other side of that, Anthony has spent innumerable hours in planning for major live events in a number of venues ranging from musical and dramatic productions in large auditoriums to small house concerts.",
